cs:UpperSecondaryDeptSNES\/2009\/2009 rdf:type cs:CourseOfStudyRevision.
cs:UpperSecondaryDeptSNES\/2019\/2019 rdf:type cs:CourseOfStudyRevision.
cs:dataset rdfs:domain cs:CourseOfStudyRevision.
